   "text": "I'll share what I think matters for non-technical folks\nusing AI daily, but I want to flag upfront that some of\nthis is [inference]...\n\nMental models that seem to help:\n1. AI is a thinking partner, not an oracle. People often\ntreat AI like a search engine (\"give me the answer\")…",
